	)
	(text "One cassette-shell cartridge carrying both halves of the Astrocade FujiNet stack.  Signal flow left to right:\nPC / power  ->  USB-C + CP2102N  ->  ESP32-S3 (FujiNet, WiFi, microSD)  ->  native USB  ->  RP2354A  ->  console bus."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 45.72 40.64 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "24369b18-0bf4-5133-a504-4091c28aa1fa")
	)
	(text "UART + auto-program: esptool resets the S3 into\nits ROM loader over DTR/RTS."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 45.72 125.73 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "52d87f33-5281-55d4-8a55-a83daeba8be2")
	)
	(text "USB host of the RP (CDC device, VID 0xCafe); embeds the RP\nfirmware and re-flashes it over PICOBOOT when it changes:\nIO4 pulses RUN while IO5 holds QSPI_SS low."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 165.1 125.73 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "deb12551-bd37-578b-85aa-dafbb8fb6de1")
	)
	(text "Serves the 8K cart window and the FujiNet mailbox straight\noff the 5 V bus (5 V-tolerant pads, no level shifters).\nEdge: A0-A12, D0-D7, /CCS (pre-decoded enable), +5V, 3 x GND.\nThe console only ever reads the cart."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 284.48 125.73 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a027a725-2fdf-5006-916a-cd2e20f64430")
	)
	(text "Rails (power symbols, global):\n  CONS_5V  console +5V, edge land 25\n  VBUS     USB-C\n  +5V      CONS_5V / VBUS diode-OR -> buck, LDO, WS2812\n  +3V3     AP63203 buck -> ESP32-S3, CP2102N, microSD\n  +3V3_RP  AP2112K LDO -> RP2354A (all supplies)\n  DVDD     RP2350 on-chip core SMPS (1.1 V)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 45.72 190.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ee812e6a-f747-52c7-84d6-57cc195d98a4")
	)
	(text "Not verifiable in CAD (bring-up checklist, README):\n - console cold start: +3V3_RP vs CA*/CCS_N rise (scope)\n - /CCS-to-data timing against the Z80 read cycle\n - console 5 V headroom under WiFi bursts\n - blade reach vs the land escape holes (17.4 mm)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 165.1 157.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "57c2852c-7423-54a0-8359-17d4a1be778b")
	)
	(text "License CERN-OHL-W-2.0.  Circuit blocks from FujiNet-INTV-Rev0 (PiNTY CARD) and the ESP32-S3-DevKitC-1;\nRP2350 regulator corner from the Raspberry Pi RP2350A minimal design (MIT)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
